Prime Agent (Rubiks) is a modified version of Prime Agent
(https://github.com/PrimeIntellect-ai/prime-agent), Copyright (c) 2025-2026
Prime Intellect Ltd., released under the MIT License (see LICENSE-MIT).

The Rubiks Workspace authors have modified this code, starting on 2026-10-13.
The changes keep telemetry off unless it is turned on, add the
`prime-agent data` command and the research log, include Zed's command-line
interface, add provider retries and other unattended-run behaviour, add the
run-tests skill and the SWE-bench Pro benchmark, and publish and update from
this repository's GitHub releases. The git history records each change and its
date.

Because it includes Zed's command-line interface, the whole is released under
GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE). vendor/zed-cli comes from Rubiks IDE, a modified
version of Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed), Copyright Zed Industries,
Inc., under GPL-3.0-or-later with Apache-2.0 parts (see its LICENSE files).
vendor/crossterm keeps its own license (see vendor/crossterm/LICENSE).

